# Defense in depth if private files are accidentally placed below package directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config.json
**/identity.json
**/ui-settings.json
**/materials.json
**/browser-profile/
**/original-browser-profile/
**/chrome-profile/
**/jobs/
**/reports/
**/recordings/
**/backups/
**/*.state.json
**/*.jsonl
**/original-ledger.json
**/original-runner.lock
